        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VAtr">V Atr</ref> 10.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ sy ælc cirice on Godes griðe ⁊ on ðæs cynges ⁊ on ealles Cristenes folces.</ab>
